M6.8: per-shader ScreenPositionScaleBias register
 (CTAB) for the uv remap - fixes additive light passes sampling the
 attenuation buffer at unremapped uv

---
 src/d3d9/d3d9_device.cpp | 77 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-----------
 1 file changed, 57 insertions(+), 20 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/d3d9/d3d9_device.cpp b/src/d3d9/d3d9_device.cpp
